    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f9b098bf31a3a01012f5e35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "その後も彼女はいつも通りに明るく振舞う。\r\nだがその横顔には複雑な想いが見えた。\r\n終わりの時は近い……次は『大阪杯』だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d95c62b7cdaa9157515a9966fa30885813ef8978880d420b17196a747890434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022429.json",
